sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente (Browser)
    participant F as Frontend (Next.js)
    participant B as Backend (Express)

    C->>F: Preenche formulário de login
    F->>B: POST /api/auth/login { email, senha, role }
    B-->>F: { token, user: { id, nome, email, role } }
    F->>F: localStorage.setItem("token", token)
    F->>F: localStorage.setItem("user", JSON.stringify(user))
    F-->>C: Redireciona para /professor ou /aluno

    Note over C,B: Requisições subsequentes

    C->>F: Navega para página protegida
    F->>F: getStoredUser() — verifica localStorage
    F->>B: GET /api/turmas (Authorization: Bearer token)
    B->>B: authenticateToken() — valida JWT
    B->>B: req.user = { id, role }
    B-->>F: Dados da turma
    F-->>C: Renderiza página
